Upstream-Name: pyright
Upstream-Contact: https://github.com/microsoft/pyright/issues
Source: https://github.com/microsoft/pyright
Comment:
 The binary package contains a bundle (built with rspack) of pyright and
 the third-party JavaScript libraries it uses at run time, as resolved by
 upstream's pnpm-lock.yaml. Those libraries are under their own, mostly
 MIT/ISC/BSD-style, licenses; see the upstream lockfile for the list.

